    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In the middle of a desert in California, one company is trying to solve two problems at once."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Problem one is “Energy "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "demand",
            "ref": "v-demand"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " rises at night”. Problem two is “Electric vehicle (EV) batteries "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "contain",
            "ref": "v-contain"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " a lot of precious metals”. It takes mountains of energy to get these metals from the Earth, and as time goes on, the battery’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "mileage range",
            "ref": "v-mileage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " drops. Drivers often replace their cars long before the batteries stop working completely."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "B2U Storage Solutions is reusing these old batteries to store clean energy. “It’s pretty simple,” said Rachel Harper from B2U. They use a solar farm with rows of solar "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "panels",
            "zh": "面板"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Next to them are white "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "trailers",
            "zh": "拖车"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " holding over 1,000 used EV batteries. These batteries still hold 60–70% of their original charge capacity. They store energy produced by the solar panels during the day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "When sunlight hits the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "photovoltaic cells",
            "zh": "光伏电池"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the panels, the energy is collected and "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "converted",
            "ref": "v-convert"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " into a form the batteries can store. At night, the energy is sent to California’s power "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "grid",
            "zh": "网"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "B2U makes money because solar power’s price varies according to the time of day. It’s cheaper when the sun is up. It’s more expensive when it has to be stored in a battery for later use after the sun sets. As Los Angeles plans to use only "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "renewable",
            "ref": "v-renewable"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " energy by 2045, they are willing to pay that extra price."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Currently, B2U doesn’t face much competition because there aren’t many old EV batteries "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "available",
            "ref": "v-available"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " yet. But that’s changing. “Only about 30,000 EVs were sold in the early years, but now over two million are sold each year,” said co-founder Freeman Hall."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
